name fontware
category TLCore
revision 62387
catalogue vfware
shortdesc Tools for virtual font metrics
longdesc Virtual font metrics are usually created in a textual form, the
longdesc Virtual Property List, but programs that use them need to use
longdesc binary files (the Virtual Font and the TeX Font Metric). The
longdesc present two programs translate between the two forms: - vptovf
longdesc takes a VPL file and generates a VF file and a TFM file; -
longdesc vftovp takes a VF file and a TFM file and generates a VPL file.
longdesc The programs are to be found in every distribution of TeX.
depend fontware.ARCH
